{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411270","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241127001:1":{"text":"소니아, 치피가 폐허에서 이걸 찾았어요! 블러디 로즈의 마크인 것 같아요!","source_cn":"索尼娅，满满在废墟里找到了这个！好像是血薇帮的标志！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5817E04A25402EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241127002:1":{"text":"...맞아, 붉은색 장미네.","source_cn":"……没错，是红色的蔷薇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE79FF3FB8B2230FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241127003:1":{"text":"내가 보냈던 탐사대야. 무사히 돌아오기를 바라며 직접 블러디 로즈의 마크를 달아주었지.","source_cn":"是我曾经派出过的勘查队伍。我亲手给他们戴上了血薇的标志...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325551A3A8315DC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241127004:1":{"text":"하지만 돌아온 사람은 없었어.","source_cn":"但没有人回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE0BEDF3953F7D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241127005:1":{"text":"아무래도 마지막 순간까지 싸운 것 같아. 러스트 항으로 돌아가면 그들의 유해를 수습할 사람을 보내야겠어.","source_cn":"看来他们战斗到了最后一刻。回到锈锚港以后，我会派人迎接...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F43D13F9804E426","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","do